# inkrot

This repo hosts multiple Claude Code plugins:

- **docs-toolkit** (`plugins/docs-toolkit/`) — Schema-driven documentation validation. Enforces structure, naming, frontmatter, and status lifecycle across {{SCHEMA_COUNT}} document types, all derived from JSON schemas as the single source of truth.
- **hr** (`plugins/hr/`) — Role profiling and agent definition generation. Takes a task description, researches the current market, produces a professional HR-style competency profile, and optionally generates a Claude Code agent `.md` file from the profile.

## Installation

```
/plugin marketplace add obzenner/inkrot
/plugin install inkrot@docs-toolkit
/plugin install inkrot@hr
```

